    <briefdescription>
<para>Extracts structured fields from an administrative decision text. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Recognises German patterns such as:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&quot;Aktenzeichen:&quot; / &quot;Az.:&quot; / &quot;Geschäftszeichen:&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;Antragsteller:&quot; / &quot;Antragstellerin:&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;Datum:&quot; / &quot;Bescheid vom&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;Auflage [N]:&quot; / numbered list under &quot;Auflagen&quot; section header</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;Nebenbestimmung:&quot; </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
